  "notes": [
    "Blackwater area names are now faded, single-sided wall stencils oriented toward the corridor, replacing floating labels and unreliable arrows.",
    "Station wall ribs are recessed against solid walls. Continuous overhead pipe runs meet at unions, dead ends return through anchored floor risers, and safe-room pipes penetrate the bulkheads instead of stopping in midair.",
    "The field map uses numbered objective plates, completion checkmarks, a labeled escape gate and skull icons for hunters. Survivor positions remain colored dots with their names in the left legend.",
    "Hunter range shading is clipped to the maze boundary and drawn beneath all map markers, including during the final-breaker hunt. Objective and position unlock rules remain unchanged.",
    "Windows 10/11 x64. Close the game, choose Check for updates, then Update & restart. Everyone in a co-op group should update."
  ],
